---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, telHref } from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Request received"
  description="Your window estimate request reached Clearview Windows in Vancouver, WA."
  path="/estimate/sent"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Request an estimate', href: '/estimate' }]}
  noindex
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Received</p>
      <h1>We have your request.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Mark will follow up, usually the same day, to set a time to measure the openings.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap sent-layout" data-reveal>
      <figure class="confirm-mark">
        <span class="confirm-mark-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48">
            <path d="M8 41 L8 20 A16 16 0 0 1 40 20 L40 41 Z" fill="url(#sentGlass)" stroke="#122033" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="round" />
            <path d="M8 20h32M24 20v21" stroke="#122033" stroke-width="2.3" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <path d="M13.5 12 L22 18.5" stroke="#f6f1e8" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.55" />
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="sentGlass" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#d9efec" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#1f6f73" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
          </svg>
          <span class="confirm-badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" fill="none" stroke="#f4f4f2" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
          </span>
        </span>
        <figcaption>Clearview Windows — Vancouver, WA</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="sent-note">
        <p class="rule-label">What happens now</p>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><strong>Mark reads it.</strong> Usually within the hour.</li>
          <li><strong>He calls you back.</strong> Same day, most days.</li>
          <li><strong>You book a measure.</strong> Free, and it ends in writing.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-sunk">
    <div class="wrap split" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="rule-label">Sooner is fine</p>
        <p class="sent-phone"><a href={telHref()}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a></p>
        <p>If something changed or you want to talk it through now, call. Mark answers from the truck.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="rule-label">While you wait</p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li><a href="/guides/signs-you-need-new-windows">Six signs it is time to replace</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/full-frame-vs-insert">Full-frame vs insert</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/window-replacement-cost-washington">What a project costs in Washington</a></li>
          <li><a href="/gallery">See recent work</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // GA4 conversion signal for the no-JS fallback path: estimate.js 303s here
  // on a real form post, which is a hard navigation, so this runs once per
  // arrival — no astro:page-load listener needed the way trackPageView()
  // needs one, since this page is never reached by client-side routing.
  // The JS-intercepted submit path pushes the same event itself, from
  // EstimateForm.astro, because it never navigates here at all.
  try {
    // @ts-expect-error — initialized by the GTM snippet in BaseLayout's <head>.
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
    // @ts-expect-error — see above.
    window.dataLayer.push({ event: 'generate_lead', method: 'estimate_form_no_js' });
  } catch {
    // Analytics plumbing should never be able to break this confirmation page.
  }
</script>

<style>
  .sent-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .confirm-mark {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .confirm-mark-icon {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    width: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 8.25rem);
  }

  .confirm-mark-icon svg:first-child {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 34px rgb(11 12 14 / 0.22));
  }

  .confirm-badge {
    position: absolute;
    right: -0.4rem;
    bottom: -0.4rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 34%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    border: 3px solid var(--paper-raised);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .confirm-badge svg {
    width: 58%;
    height: 58%;
  }

  .confirm-mark figcaption {
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .sent-note .rule-label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-s);
  }

  /* The default link underline ran through the parentheses and read as a
     typo. Same treatment as the estimate page's number. */
  .sent-phone {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2xs);
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .sent-phone a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .sent-phone a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .sent-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-l);
    }
  }
</style>
